#. Description of the plugin
#: feedtrix.php
msgid "Optimizes your store for AI search engines (AEO): price and stock webhooks, a dynamic /llms.txt file, AI bot statistics and IndexNow."
msgstr "Optimiert Ihren Shop für KI-Suchmaschinen (AEO): Webhooks bei Preis- und Bestandsänderungen, dynamische /llms.txt-Datei, Statistiken zu KI-Bots und IndexNow."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:244
#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:353
#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:445
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:591
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Funktionen"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:601
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Erweitert"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:455
msgid "Serve /llms.txt"
msgstr "/llms.txt bereitstellen"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:407
#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:460
msgid "AI bot statistics"
msgstr "KI-Bot-Statistiken"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:602
msgid "FeedTrix API URL"
msgstr "FeedTrix-API-URL"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:360
msgid "There is an llms.txt file in the WordPress root directory. The web server will serve it instead of the FeedTrix version. Delete it to enable the dynamic file."
msgstr "Im WordPress-Stammverzeichnis liegt eine Datei llms.txt. Der Webserver liefert sie anstelle der FeedTrix-Version aus. Löschen Sie sie, um die dynamische Datei zu aktivieren."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:623
msgid "This plugin was downloaded from the FeedTrix panel and already contains your store keys."
msgstr "Dieses Plugin wurde aus dem FeedTrix-Panel heruntergeladen und enthält bereits die Schlüssel Ihres Shops."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:430
msgid "Your store is connected to FeedTrix"
msgstr "Ihr Shop ist mit FeedTrix verbunden"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:433
msgid "Account:"
msgstr "Konto:"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:439
msgid "Confirm your email address using the link we sent you. Then choose a plan in the panel (7 days free)."
msgstr "Bestätigen Sie Ihre E-Mail-Adresse über den Link, den wir Ihnen gesendet haben. Wählen Sie dann im Panel einen Tarif (7 Tage kostenlos)."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:435
msgid "File for AI bots:"
msgstr "Datei für KI-Bots:"

