msgid "FeedTrix"
msgstr "FeedTrix"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:465
msgid "Sales from AI (order attribution)"
msgstr "Umsatz aus KI (Bestellzuordnung)"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-json-ld.php:237
#: includes/class-feedtrix-json-ld.php:240
msgid "Questions and answers"
msgstr "Fragen und Antworten"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:470
msgid "FeedTrix structured data (JSON-LD) on product pages"
msgstr "Strukturierte Daten von FeedTrix (JSON-LD) auf Produktseiten"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:475
msgid "Show the questions and answers tab on product pages"
msgstr "Tab mit Fragen und Antworten auf Produktseiten anzeigen"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:639
msgid "Add this store in the FeedTrix panel, then copy its keys from: Shops → your shop → Integration keys."
msgstr "Fügen Sie diesen Shop im FeedTrix-Panel hinzu und kopieren Sie dann seine Schlüssel unter: Shops → Ihr Shop → Integrationsschlüssel."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:352
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:384
msgid "Your store"
msgstr "Ihr Shop"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:384
msgid "WooCommerce products, prices and stock"
msgstr "WooCommerce-Produkte, Preise und Bestände"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:385
msgid "Writes /llms.txt, structured data and AI descriptions"
msgstr "Erstellt /llms.txt, strukturierte Daten und KI-Beschreibungen"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:386
msgid "AI assistants"
msgstr "KI-Assistenten"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:387
msgid "New customers"
msgstr "Neue Kunden"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:387
msgid "AI recommends your products and links to your store"
msgstr "Die KI empfiehlt Ihre Produkte und verlinkt auf Ihren Shop"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:391
msgid "Get your store recommended by ChatGPT, Perplexity and Claude"
msgstr "Lassen Sie ChatGPT, Perplexity und Claude Ihren Shop empfehlen"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:392
msgid "More and more customers ask AI assistants what to buy. FeedTrix prepares your catalog so that AI understands it, recommends your products and sends buyers to your store."
msgstr "Immer mehr Kunden fragen KI-Assistenten, was sie kaufen sollen. FeedTrix bereitet Ihren Katalog so auf, dass die KI ihn versteht, Ihre Produkte empfiehlt und Käufer in Ihren Shop schickt."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:406
msgid "Visible in AI answers"
msgstr "Sichtbar in KI-Antworten"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:406
msgid "/llms.txt and JSON-LD generated from your catalog, updated after every price or stock change."
msgstr "/llms.txt und JSON-LD aus Ihrem Katalog, aktualisiert nach jeder Preis- oder Bestandsänderung."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:407
msgid "See which AI bots visit your store and which pages they read."
msgstr "Sehen Sie, welche KI-Bots Ihren Shop besuchen und welche Seiten sie lesen."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:408
msgid "Sales from AI"
msgstr "Verkäufe durch KI"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:408
msgid "Orders from customers who came from AI assistants, in one report."
msgstr "Bestellungen von Kunden, die über KI-Assistenten kamen, in einem Bericht."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:413
msgid "Sign up in FeedTrix"
msgstr "Bei FeedTrix registrieren"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:414
msgid "Add your store and copy its keys"
msgstr "Shop hinzufügen und Schlüssel kopieren"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:415
msgid "Paste the keys in Settings"
msgstr "Schlüssel in den Einstellungen einfügen"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:418
msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Registrieren"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:419
msgid "I already have keys"
msgstr "Ich habe bereits Schlüssel"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:456
msgid "A file for AI bots with your catalog, served from your domain."
msgstr "Eine Datei für KI-Bots mit Ihrem Katalog, ausgeliefert von Ihrer Domain."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:461
msgid "Counts visits of AI bots (no personal data) and sends them to FeedTrix every hour."
msgstr "Zählt Besuche von KI-Bots (ohne personenbezogene Daten) und sendet sie stündlich an FeedTrix."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:466
msgid "Marks paid orders from customers who came from AI assistants in the last 30 days."
msgstr "Markiert bezahlte Bestellungen von Kunden, die in den letzten 30 Tagen über KI-Assistenten kamen."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:471
msgid "Adds AI descriptions, attributes and FAQ to the product data read by AI and search engines."
msgstr "Ergänzt KI-Beschreibungen, Merkmale und FAQ in den Produktdaten, die KI und Suchmaschinen lesen."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:476
msgid "A visible tab with questions and answers prepared by FeedTrix."
msgstr "Ein sichtbarer Tab mit Fragen und Antworten von FeedTrix."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:621
msgid "Store keys"
msgstr "Shop-Schlüssel"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:640
msgid "No account yet? Sign up"
msgstr "Noch kein Konto? Registrieren"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:491
msgid "Working in your store"
msgstr "Aktiv in Ihrem Shop"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:498
msgid "On"
msgstr "Ein"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:498
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Aus"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:505
msgid "Change in Settings"
msgstr "In den Einstellungen ändern"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:532
msgid "Your bestseller"
msgstr "Ihr Bestseller"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:542
msgid "What your customer sees"
msgstr "Was Ihr Kunde sieht"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:543
msgid "This is how an AI assistant can recommend your store once it knows your catalog."
msgstr "So kann ein KI-Assistent Ihren Shop empfehlen, sobald er Ihren Katalog kennt."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:545
msgid "Up-to-date prices and availability"
msgstr "Aktuelle Preise und Verfügbarkeit"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:546
msgid "A direct link to the product in your store"
msgstr "Ein direkter Link zum Produkt in Ihrem Shop"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:547
msgid "The sale is attributed to AI in your report"
msgstr "Der Verkauf wird in Ihrem Bericht der KI zugeordnet"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:551
msgid "AI assistant"
msgstr "KI-Assistent"

